{"4079560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Around the Block", "steam_appid": 4079560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a wide variety of building types to develop your island. Each building has its own area of effect and can either boost or negatively affect the scores of other buildings in that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.poster.avif?t=1775506361\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.webm?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.mp4?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Strategically place buildings next to each for a bigger score boost. A bigger score means more currency. More currency means you can buy more buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strategize</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Place Buildings</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Boost Score</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Collect Currency</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Repeat</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/b415a2e9a30578a887d0692a25b2409c.poster.avif?t=1775506361\" width=800 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/b415a2e9a30578a887d0692a25b2409c.webm?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/b415a2e9a30578a887d0692a25b2409c.mp4?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from a wide variety of building types to develop your island. Each building has its own area of effect and can either boost or negatively affect the scores of other buildings in that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.poster.avif?t=1775506361\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.webm?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/f21d9054881053834a42ef12dd2a17f3.mp4?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Strategically place buildings next to each for a bigger score boost. A bigger score means more currency. More currency means you can buy more buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strategize</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Place Buildings</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Boost Score</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Collect Currency</strong></u> -&gt; <u><strong>Repeat</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/b415a2e9a30578a887d0692a25b2409c.poster.avif?t=1775506361\" width=800 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/b415a2e9a30578a887d0692a25b2409c.webm?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/extras/b415a2e9a30578a887d0692a25b2409c.mp4?t=1775506361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A minimalistic city builder where you can rack up tons of points for your island by strategically placing buildings on blocks around each other.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/6a2120c322532e8b0a7bf4786efb99ff2edee3b2/header.jpg?t=1775506361", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/82b9e2328d69e2b5e455f3b5caa3c20ede637f81/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775506361", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079560/82b9e2328d69e2b5e455f3b5caa3c20ede637f81/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775506361", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 5th Generation Intel® Core™ i3 Processors<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 5th Generation Intel® Core™ i5 Processors - 2.90 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nullvoid Games"], "publishers": ["Nullvoid Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 4185090, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 699, "final": 279, "discount_percent": 60, "initial_formatted": "$6.99", "final_formatted": "$2.79"}, "packages": [1430183